      "message": "nit (because I don\u0027t know what style we want to use and both seem reasonable):\n\nInstead of deleting the node I am 97.55% sure we can actually reference the node and overwrite the properties you\u0027d like to change.\n\nSomething like:\n\n```\n\u0026ps8xxx_emul1 {\n\t\tp0-i2c-addr \u003d \u003c0x8\u003e;\n\t\tp1-i2c-addr \u003d \u003c0x9\u003e;\n\t\tgpio-i2c-addr \u003d \u003c0x1a\u003e;\n\n}\n```",
